      "text": "UC Santa Barbara — 19 sections: Front matter; Abstract; Introduction\n\n**UC Santa Barbara**\n\n*UC Santa Barbara Electronic Theses and Dissertations*\n\n106 pp, 19 sections.\n\n**Outline.** Front matter; Abstract; Introduction; Higher Categories; Ribbon Fusion Categories; G-crossed Braided Spherical Fusion Categories ; Monoidal 2-categories with Duals; Invariants of 4-manifolds; Partition Function; A Formula for the Partition Function; Examples; Variation: Trivial G-grading; Proof of Invariance; Invariance under Choice of Representatives; Invariance under change of ordering; Pachner Moves; Invariance under Pachner Moves; Future Directions and Open Questions",
